<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT</view><view class="title">我的</view><view class="card profile"><image wx:if="{{user.avatarUrl}}" class="avatar-image" src="{{user.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="avatar">WS</view><view><view class="card-title">{{user.nickname || user.username || '微信用户'}}</view><view class="small muted">{{user.username}} · {{user.timezone || 'Asia/Shanghai'}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card menu"><view class="item" bindtap="bindEmail">邮箱：{{user.email || '未绑定'}}<text>›</text></view><view class="divider"/><view class="item" bindtap="orders">订单记录<text>›</text></view><view class="divider"/><view class="item" bindtap="accounts">发送账号<text>›</text></view><view class="divider"/><view class="item" bindtap="friends">好友管理<text>›</text></view><view class="divider"/><view class="item" bindtap="templates">文案模板<text>›</text></view><view class="divider"/><view class="item" bindtap="variables">内容变量<text>›</text></view><view class="divider"/><view class="item" bindtap="membership">会员套餐<text>›</text></view></view><button class="button secondary logout" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button><view class="note">P5 微信身份已绑定<br/>“邮件已发送”不代表微信已送达</view></view>
